# 🚀 Python Programming Lab & Learning Repository

A collection of **Python programming notebooks and practice exercises** covering fundamental programming concepts, Object-Oriented Programming (OOP), NumPy, Pandas, and Data Visualization.

This repository documents my learning journey in Python and serves as a reference for understanding core programming concepts and their practical implementation using Jupyter Notebooks.

---

# 📚 Repository Overview

The notebooks included in this repository cover a wide range of Python topics, starting from basic syntax and programming constructs to data analysis and visualization techniques.

The repository is intended to:

* Strengthen Python programming fundamentals
* Practice problem-solving techniques
* Explore Object-Oriented Programming concepts
* Learn numerical computing using NumPy
* Perform data analysis using Pandas
* Create visualizations using Matplotlib

---

# 🗂 Topics Covered

| Category                    | Concepts                                                                                 |
| --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Python Fundamentals         | Variables, Data Types, Input/Output, Operators, Conditional Statements, Loops, Functions |
| Data Structures             | Lists, Tuples, Dictionaries, Sets                                                        |
| Object-Oriented Programming | Classes, Objects, Constructors, Inheritance, Polymorphism, Abstraction, Encapsulation    |
| NumPy                       | Arrays, Array Operations, Indexing, Slicing, Mathematical Functions                      |
| Pandas                      | DataFrames, Data Cleaning, Data Manipulation, Data Analysis                              |
| Data Visualization          | Line Graphs, Scatter Plots, Bar Charts, Histograms                                       |

---

# 🛠 Technologies Used

* Python 3
* Jupyter Notebook
* NumPy
* Pandas
* Matplotlib

---

# 📁 Notebook Structure

| Notebook                                          | Description                                |
| ------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| Basic_python.ipynb                                | Python fundamentals and syntax             |
| Operators_24_jan.ipynb                            | Python operators and expressions           |
| 14_feb_FUNCTION.ipynb                             | Functions and modular programming          |
| 18_march_OOP.ipynb                                | Object-Oriented Programming concepts       |
| 8_April_(Numpy).ipynb                             | NumPy arrays and operations                |
| 10_April_NUMPY_&_PANDAS.ipynb                     | Data manipulation using NumPy and Pandas   |
| 12_April_GRAPH.ipynb                              | Introduction to graph plotting             |
| 13_APRIL_(SCATTER_PLOT,BAR_CHART,HISTOGRAM).ipynb | Data visualization techniques              |
| More Notebooks                                    | Additional learning and practice exercises |

